"synthesizer, such as TiMidity++ or FluidSynth, to be launched automatically "
"when KMid starts. This option is located in the dialog Settings->Configure "
"KMid, programs category. You can find more information in the <link "
"url='help:/kmid/general-usage.html#using-midi'>online help documents</link>."
